OL,14,     Flipomas the clinic has seen; Dr
OL,15,     FNatalia deals with a supersized
OL,16,     Fwarty lesion; Dr Emma sorts out a
OL,17,     Fcyst that patient Barry's wife has
OL,18,     Fenjoyed squeezing.
